title: mauled_by_monsters
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands placeholder>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "Mauled by the Darkness">>
<<sfx YarnCommands chaosoccurs>>
You hear a low growl from the darkness. A pack of shadowy creatures emerges from the surrounding gloom, their claws and teeth glinting in the faint light.
They lunge at you from every direction. You have little time to think.
<<jump mauled_by_monsters_1>>
===

title: mauled_by_monsters_1
---
The first creature lunges, their claws aiming for your flesh.
-> Desperately fend it off #paneldetails=50%_chance_to_lose_10%_Health
    <<if chance(50)>>
        <<change_health_percent -10>><<sfx YarnCommands hit>><<flash YarnCommands red 0.3>>
        You retailate, but not before its claws rake across your side.
    <<else>>
        You evade at the last moment and strike the creature dead.
    <<endif>>
    <<jump mauled_by_monsters_2>>
-> [gold]Stay calm and predict their movements[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight._Avoid_Damage.
    <<spend_insight 1>>
    You steady your breathing and read the creature's movements before it attacks.
    You evade the lunge completely and force it back into the darkness.
    <<jump mauled_by_monsters_2>>
===

title: mauled_by_monsters_2
---
Another monster circles behind you, ready to strike.
-> Brace yourself #paneldetails=50%_chance_to_lose_10%_Health
    <<if chance(50)>>
        <<change_health_percent -10>><<sfx YarnCommands hit>><<flash YarnCommands red 0.3>>
        Surprised, you have no time to react as it lands a clean hit on you.
    <<else>>
        You use its momentum against it, sending it crashing into its packmate.
    <<endif>>
    <<jump mauled_by_monsters_3>>
-> [gold]Prepare your blade and stab it as it lunges[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight._Avoid_Damage.
    <<spend_insight 1>>
    Its pounce ends in its timely demise as it lunges straight onto the tip of your blade.
    <<jump mauled_by_monsters_3>>
===

title: mauled_by_monsters_3
---
The pack gathers around you again, their glowing eyes multiplying in the darkness.
One of them leaps high while the others close in from below.
-> Wildly swing your blade #paneldetails=50%_chance_to_lose_10%_Health
    <<if chance(50)>>
        <<change_health_percent -10>><<sfx YarnCommands hit>><<flash YarnCommands red 0.3>>
        You knock the leaping monster away, but another claws your leg as it passes.
    <<else>>
        You wait until the last possible moment, then roll beneath the attack and slash at the creature's exposed flank.
    <<endif>>
    <<jump mauled_by_monsters_4>>
-> [gold]Dodge and let them crash into one another[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight._Avoid_Damage.
    <<spend_insight 1>>
    You remain still long enough to see the attack's true pattern.
    At the last moment, you evade, allowing the two creatures to crash into each other.
    <<jump mauled_by_monsters_4>>
===

title: mauled_by_monsters_4
---
The monsters grow more desperate, swarming over the ground like a living tide.
-> Break through before they surround you #paneldetails=50%_chance_to_lose_10%_Health
    <<if chance(50)>>
        <<change_health_percent -10>><<sfx YarnCommands hit>><<flash YarnCommands red 0.3>>
        You break through the swarm, but several claws find their mark before you escape.
    <<else>>
        You keep moving and refuse to let the pack surround you, cutting a path through the swarm.
    <<endif>>
    <<jump mauled_by_monsters_5>>
-> [gold]Find the weakest link[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight._Avoid_Damage.
    <<spend_insight 1>>
    You discern those who lagged behind and take advantage of the opening to slip through.
    <<jump mauled_by_monsters_5>>
===

title: mauled_by_monsters_5
---
The largest of them finally steps forward; a Tall Boy towering over the rest of the pack.
It raises its arms and brings them down in a crushing blow.
-> Fight with everything you got #paneldetails=50%_chance_to_lose_10%_Health
    <<if chance(50)>>
        <<change_health_percent -10>><<sfx YarnCommands hit>><<flash YarnCommands red 0.3>>
        You stop the creature's arms from closing on you, but its shockwave leaves a deep bruise across your body.
    <<else>>
        You predict the slam, sidestep the attack, and drive the monster into the ground.
    <<endif>>
    The darkness subsides, and the assault finally comes to an end.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
-> [gold]Raise your lantern up high[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight._Avoid_Damage.
    <<spend_insight 1>>
    You raise your lantern high.
    Its radiance floods the darkness, forcing the creatures to retreat as the assault finally comes to an end.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===
